WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:06.110
As well as this recap video, we've got a new
video out about the first episode of The Expanse

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.429
Season 6, that you can watch now at the link
below.

00:00:10.429 --> 00:00:18.030
The Expanse is a show about space, war, family,
politics, alien mysteries, and Shohreh Aghdashloo

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.570
bein sassy – “Wherever I goddamn like”.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:27.400
The sixth and final season is coming soon,
so what’s happened in the story so far?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.320
In Season 1, humanity is divided into Earth,
Mars and the Belt.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:38.699
Earth is powerful, but it’s old and slow,
its environment strained by overpopulation.

00:00:38.699 --> 00:00:45.390
Mars is a new rival superpower, with advanced
technology, unified by the dream of terraforming

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.390
Mars.

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.530
The asteroid Belt and outer planets are mined
for resources.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:55.109
The people of the Belt have their own culture
and language, and bodies, adapted to space.

00:00:55.109 --> 00:01:00.729
But the Belters are oppressed and exploited
by Earth and Mars, so activists and extremists

00:01:00.729 --> 00:01:04.780
like the OPA fight for freedom for the Belt.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:10.790
In Episode 1, a mining ship called the Canterbury
is mysteriously destroyed, sparking conflict

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.750
across the solar system.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:18.490
Four survivors of the attack form an unlikely
crew – Holden is an idealistic hero type

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:26.110
from Earth, Naomi is a secretive smart engineer
from the Belt, Alex is a loveable pilot from

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.560
Mars, and Amos is.. complicated.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:34.080
Amos grew up in Baltimore as a victim of organised
crime.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:40.750
He’s emotionally detached, and often violent,
but he follows Naomi as his moral guiding

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:41.750
light.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:48.550
Together, they steal a ship- or rather, they
legally acquire a ship by legitimate salvage,

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.840
and they name it the Rocinante.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:57.030
The Roci crew uncover a conspiracy with the
help of a cynical cop called Miller.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.210
Miller investigates a missing girl called
Julie Mao.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:05.390
It turns out she was killed by a mysterious
alien virus called the protomolecule.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:11.030
Julie’s father, a powerful businessman called
Jules-Pierre Mao, experiments with the virus

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.980
to make it a weapon.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.900
He blew up the Canterbury to deliberately
cause war.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.760
And now to study the protomolecule, Jules-Pierre
infects a hundred thousand innocent people

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.810
on the moon of Eros.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.810
Miller and the Roci crew fight to escape and
survive.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.470
But the protomolecule on Eros starts building
some weird scary alien shit.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:39.170
So with the help of OPA leader Fred Johnson,
the crew try to knock Eros into the sun by

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:43.220
hitting it with a giant Mormon spaceship called
the Nauvoo.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:48.610
But the protomolecule makes Eros dodge the
Nauvoo, and Eros speeds towards Earth.

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:55.910
So Miller journeys into Eros, and finds Julie
Mao’s consciousness alive inside the protomolecule.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:03:02.490
He convinces Julie to crash Eros into Venus,
and they disappear into the clouds together.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:09.099
So in the face of war and aliens, the Roci
crew come together as an unlikely family.

00:03:09.099 --> 00:03:10.850
And they learn from each other.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:16.910
Holden starts out as a dangerously impulsive
naïve hero, but Naomi helps him make smarter

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:20.650
decisions – and eventually they fall in
love.

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:26.190
Miller challenges Holden’s moral idealism
and teaches him to be more ruthless to get

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:27.190
shit done.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:31.349
Amos comes to trust Holden as a leader alongside
Naomi.

00:03:31.349 --> 00:03:35.349
And Alex.. makes really good lasagne.

00:03:35.349 --> 00:03:40.910
While the Roci crew flies around saving the
worlds, Avasarala handles the politics.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:46.930
Avasarala is a powerful politician in the
United Nations, the government of Earth.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:51.640
In Season 1, she’s ruthless in protecting
Earth from Belters and Martians.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:57.430
She tortures, blackmails, lies and betrays
cause she believes that “Earth must come

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.560
first”.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:02.761
But then she discovers that the conspiracy
behind the war didn’t come from the Belt

00:04:02.761 --> 00:04:04.140
or Mars.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:09.520
People in her own government conspired with
Jules-Pierre to weaponise the protomolecule.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:14.099
So Avasarala fights the conspiracy with the
help of Bobbie.

00:04:14.099 --> 00:04:18.530
Bobbie is a tough Martian soldier, fiercely
loyal to Mars.

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:22.580
But her squad gets killed by a protomolecule
monster.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:27.710
And she find outs that the Martian government
was behind this – they also work with Jules-Pierre

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:34.560
to weaponise the protomolecule – transforming
children into protomolecule killing machines.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:39.970
So Bobbie defects from Mars, suits up, and
fights to help Avasarala and the Roci crew

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.370
end the war.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:46.060
They kill some protomolecule monsters, and
they help a botanist called Prax save his

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.160
daughter Mei.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:52.810
So these Earthers, Martians and Belters put
aside their differences, and work together

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.580
to make peace.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:05:00.750
This story is about the tribal politics that
divide us, and the common humanity that can

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.500
unite us.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:07.100
But meanwhile, alien forces grow on Venus.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:12.740
In Season 3, the protomolecule that crashed
into Venus rises back up from the clouds and

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:18.320
forms a mysterious Ring – like a star gate
or worm hole.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:24.070
Everyone goes to investigate, and among them
is Clarissa, Jules-Pierre Mao’s eldest daughter.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:30.800
Clarissa wants to avenge her father’s downfall
by destroying Holden.She gets high-tech bio

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:34.930
implants that enhance her speed and strength
for short bursts.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:41.330
They’re terrible for her health long-term,
but all Clarissa wants now is revenge.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:45.110
So Clarissa kills a bunch of people and frames
Holden for the crime.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:50.870
So the Roci flees through the Ring into the
mysterious alien space within.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:56.150
Holden gets visions of Miller, whose consciousness
now exists within the protomolecule.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:06:01.940
Miller guides him to the Ring Station, a mysterious
structure at the centre of the Ring space.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:07.570
And Holden learns that the Ring and the protomolecule
were created by some ancient aliens called

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.570
the Builders.

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:14.720
But the Builders were destroyed by some other
mysterious alien entities.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:21.540
Naomi works on the Behemoth, a giant OPA ship
converted from the old Mormon ship the Nauvoo.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:26.110
The Behemoth represents the dream of a free
Belter nation.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:32.240
Naomi’s friend captain Drummer clashes with
Ashford, over their.. differing views on governance.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:36.500
The Ring’s security system suddenly traps
everyone in the Ring space.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.930
Many die from a sudden deceleration of their
ships.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:44.949
Drummer and Ashford work together to survive,
and Ashford welcomes Earthers and Martians

00:06:44.949 --> 00:06:46.759
to heal on the Behemoth.

00:06:46.759 --> 00:06:50.850
A preacher called Anna gives emotional support
to the wounded.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:56.550
And she gives a slap to Clarissa for being
an unrepentant murderer.

00:06:56.550 --> 00:07:01.800
Ashford tries to destroy the Ring gate, which
almost destroys the whole solar system, but

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:08.120
Holden and the crew stop him, with the help
of Drummer, and Bobbie, and Anna, and Clarissa,

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:12.300
who finally lets go of revenge and helps people
instead.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:18.580
After the crisis, the Ring’s true purpose
is revealed – inside the Ring space, new

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:22.970
gates open to a thousand new habitable solar
systems.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.070
The builders didn’t make the protomolecule
to be a weapon.

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:31.220
It’s a tool that builds bridges to new worlds.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:37.680
So in Season 4, there’s a land rush as people
seek new opportunities on new worlds.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:42.659
On one planet called Ilus, there’s a conflict
between Belter settlers and an Earth corporation

00:07:42.659 --> 00:07:48.830
– even with a thousand new worlds available,
the inner planets continue to oppress the

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:49.979
Belters.

00:07:49.979 --> 00:07:54.950
The Roci crew are sent to sort it out, and
Holden investigates alien structures on the

00:07:54.950 --> 00:08:00.090
planet, whiiich accidentally causes a catastrophic
explosion and tsunami.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:07.009
So everyone hides underground, an alien infection
makes them blind, people are killed by death-slugs,

00:08:07.009 --> 00:08:08.440
it is.. no fun.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:12.980
But with the help of a scientist called Elvi
they shut down the alien tech, and the ghost

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:16.000
of Miller is finally put to rest.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:20.540
Holden defeats the murderous Earther Murtry
and restores peace.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:24.840
Elvi stays on Ilus to study the planet’s
alien tech.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:30.410
This artefact seems to be connected to the
entities who wiped out the Builders aeons

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.700
ago.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:37.190
Meanwhile on Earth, Avasarala loses most of
her political power in an election.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:41.820
Her husband leaves her for being too ruthless
and dishonest politically.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:45.180
She gets civilians killed in a failed military
strike.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:52.330
But Avasarala learns from her mistakes and
remains committed to protecting all of humanity.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:58.030
In the Ring space, the Behemoth becomes Medina
Station, the central hub for the Ring gates.

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:03.670
Drummer and Ashford make political compromises
to keep the peace between the Belt Earth and

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.670
Mars.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:10.470
Drummer hates compromising on her values as
a Belter, so she quits to be a polyamorous

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.480
space pirate instead.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:18.560
But then Ashford is killed by Belter extremist
Marco Inaros, after Drummer had let Marco

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:23.500
go free – so Drummer feels guilty for Ashford’s
death.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:28.470
On Mars, Bobbie is depressed because the Martian
dream is dying.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:32.920
Mars used to be united in the project to make
the planet a habitable world.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:37.770
But now, there’s no point in terraforming
Mars, because there are thousands of already

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:40.209
habitable worlds through the Ring gate.

00:09:40.209 --> 00:09:43.980
Bobbie’s purpose and identity as a Martian
is gone.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:49.830
So she gets involved in organised crime, and
discovers a conspiracy selling Martian stealth

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:53.180
tech and ships to Marco Inaros.

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:59.610
Marco paints some asteroids with the stealth
tech, and launches the deadly rocks towards

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:00.610
Earth.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:05.950
Cause all through the story Belters have been
exploited by Earth and Mars.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:12.500
Fred and Ashford and Dawes tried to free the
Belt through politics and diplomacy, but they

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.500
failed.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:18.070
Even when there were a thousand new worlds
through the Ring, the inner planets still

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.830
tried to take them for themselves.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:26.510
So Marco argues that Belters can only win
freedom through devastating violence against

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:27.820
Earth and Mars.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:34.310
In Season 5, Avasarala discovers Marco’s
stealth rocks, and tries to save Earth, but..

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.790
she’s too late.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:39.470
Marco’s rocks hit Earth and kill millions.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:45.080
And with the climate and ecosystem broken,
billions more will die soon.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:49.140
Avasarala fails to protect her home, and her
husband Arjun is among the dead.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:55.720
This is Avasarala’s worst nightmare, but
she refuses to kill innocent Belters for revenge.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:11:02.920
Avasarala regains power as leader of Earth,
and works to protect all people, together.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:07.899
Amos is on Earth when the rocks hit, visiting
Clarissa Mao in jail.

00:11:07.899 --> 00:11:11.709
Cause Clarissa was imprisoned for her murders
in Season 3.

00:11:11.709 --> 00:11:13.589
But Amos made friends with her.

00:11:13.589 --> 00:11:19.770
He comes to support and guide Clarissa, just
like Naomi supported him – which goes to

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.820
show how much Amos has grown.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.031
The rocks hit while Amos and Clarissa are
underground.

00:11:23.031 --> 00:11:28.990
Clarissa is in a deep dark place literally
and emotionally, but she and Amos climb their

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:34.160
way out and fight to escape an apocalyptic
Earth.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:38.070
Clarissa convinces Amos to save some innocent
people along the way.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:43.090
Amos then brings Clarissa to join the Roci
crew – despite the fact that Clarissa once

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.430
tried to kill Holden and many others.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:53.060
Amos argues that even enemies can become trusted
friends – they survive by growing their

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.060
tribe.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:59.019
Back in the day, Naomi had a relationship
with Marco Inaros, and they had a son, called

00:11:59.019 --> 00:12:00.019
Filip.

00:12:00.019 --> 00:12:05.050
When Marco committed a terrorist attack, Naomi
left him, and Marco kept Filip from seeing

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.050
Naomi.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:11.250
Ever since, Naomi felt grief and guilt at
the separation from her son.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:16.399
So now she finds Filip and finally reunites
with her long-lost son.

00:12:16.399 --> 00:12:20.550
But Filip captures her and brings her to Marco.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:27.920
Marco is a selfish narcissistic emotionally
manipulative mass murderer, and Naomi begs

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.970
Filip to leave and escape Marco’s control.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:37.210
But Filip rejects Naomi, so again Naomi is
forced to leave her son behind.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:42.870
She jumps through space to escape, suffers
on a booby-trapped ship, then jumps into space

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.440
again to warn her friends.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:51.470
Alex and Bobbie save Naomi, but Alex dies
in the high-g flight.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:57.230
Alex loved flying and helping his friends,
so Amos says it’s a worthy death.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:13:02.360
Alex’s last words are “That was one hell
of a ride”.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:07.480
Marco gets a powerful fleet of ships from
his Martian friends and calls it the Free

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:13.320
Navy – his own personal military of extremists
to dominate the system.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:18.970
Drummer and her crew are forced to join Marco’s
navy, and Drummer complies to protect her

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:19.970
family.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:25.450
But when Naomi is in danger, Drummer betrays
Marco and attacks his Free Navy to save her.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:30.800
But that gets one of Drummer’s family killed,
and two more of her partners leave her.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:36.260
The terrible cost of war is that Drummer’s
family grows smaller.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:43.040
While Naomi Alex and Amos have their own adventures,
Holden faces his greatest challenge yet – spending

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.899
some time alone without his family.

00:13:45.899 --> 00:13:51.670
But then, Marco’s Belters kill Fred Johnson
and steal a protomolecule sample, so Holden

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:57.050
and Bull and Monica try to destroy it, to
prevent the dangerous alien tech falling into

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.470
the wrong hands.

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.250
But they fail.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:06.149
Marco’s Free Navy takes control of the Ring,
including Medina Station, the all-important

00:14:06.149 --> 00:14:08.440
central hub of the Ring gates.

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:15.079
And Marco lets a rogue faction of Martians
through to a new world called Laconia.

00:14:15.079 --> 00:14:20.190
These Martians, led by someone called Admiral
Duarte, are the ones who gave Martian ships

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:25.470
to Marco, and in return, Marco gave them Fred’s
protomolecule sample.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:30.839
Duarte is working with the scientist Cortazár
to unlock the power of the protomolecule,

00:14:30.839 --> 00:14:37.600
and to use these mysterious alien structures
orbiting Laconia, to build humanity’s greatest

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.910
empire.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:44.779
But as the Laconians go through the Ring,
one of their ships is destroyed by these mysterious

00:14:44.779 --> 00:14:46.610
alien entities.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:50.519
So Season 5 shatters the balance of power.

00:14:50.519 --> 00:14:57.130
Earth is devastated, Mars is obsolete, and
Marco’s Free Navy is triumphant.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:15:04.029
Can the Roci crew, Bobbie, Drummer and Avasarala
defeat Marco and build a unified future?

00:15:04.029 --> 00:15:07.910
Is humanity at threat from the alien entities
in the Ring?

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:10.810
And what is going on on Laconia?

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:14.899
The final season of The Expanse comes out
on December 10th.

00:15:14.899 --> 00:15:20.019
Thanks to Amazon Prime Video UK for sponsoring
– please subscribe to this channel for more

00:15:20.019 --> 00:15:22.150
Expanse videos.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:28.760
Thanks to Patrons Roman Solis, Forestdew,
Valerie Lara, Maiele Whitetail, Jackson Longmire,

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:29.760
